# Build context = repo root. Keep it small: the image needs client/ (source),
# docs/changelog/ (the title screen's changelog viewer imports it with ?raw) and
# deploy/nginx.conf.
**/node_modules
client/dist
.git
.gitignore
.claude
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
saves
docs
*.md
# …except the changelog, which the title screen's viewer imports at build time with
# Vite's ?raw. Both rules above would swallow it, so it is re-included explicitly —
# the negations must come after the patterns they undo.
!docs/changelog
!docs/changelog/*.md
go.mod
notes-dont-process.md
GPU_TECTONICS_PLAN.md
